{"version":1,"content":"<p>老黃倒了，老黃倒了（哭腔）。就在昨晚，英偉達甩出一份冷冰冰的公告，<strong>聯合創始人黃仁勳辭去公司總裁、CEO 以及董事會成員的全部職務。</strong>掌舵英偉達 33 年的老黃，從公開承認婚外情到倉促謝幕，滿打滿算不足 96 小時。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586388.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.144570+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T07:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"4db06ca5f806b74a20e8012cabfba3e2903e48e3a73082a30beac8081c1688f5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}